# Line endings
#
# Everything Git detects as text is stored in the repository and checked out
# with LF. Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites files
# to CRLF and every subsequent commit shows up as a whole-file diff, which also
# breaks `biome check` (it expects LF). Run `git add --renormalize .` once after
# adding this file to normalize anything already committed with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep LF even when content sniffing is unsure.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pen text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert line endings, never show a text diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.wasm binary
*.data binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.node binary

# Generated files: collapse in review diffs and exclude from language stats.
bun.lock linguist-generated=true
